@startsalt
' Screen: Persona Library Browser (Modal / Inline Page)
' User Stories:
'   - As a test engineer, I can browse starter personas curated by the platform
'   - As a test engineer, I can search/filter by tone tag to find relevant starters
'   - As a test engineer, I can preview the system preamble before importing
'   - As a test engineer, I can import a starter persona as a local draft with one click

{
  {
    <b>Persona Library</b> — Starter Personas | [X Close]
    ..
    <i>Platform-curated starter personas. Import any to create an editable local draft.</i>
  }
  ==
  {
    " Search library...                              " | ^Any Tone Tag^  | [Search]
  }
  --
  {
    {+
      <b>Hostile User</b>
      --
      Tone: <b>hostile</b>  <b>adversarial</b>
      --
      Simulates a frustrated, combative customer who pushes back on vague or unhelpful responses.
      Tests de-escalation, boundary-holding, and empathy.
      " "
      <i>Preamble preview:</i>
      "You are roleplaying a frustrated customer. Use short, aggressive sentences. Do not accept..."
      " "
      [Import as Draft]
    }
    |
    {+
      <b>Confused Novice</b>
      --
      Tone: <b>confused</b>  <b>low-literacy</b>
      --
      Simulates a user unfamiliar with the product or domain. Uses imprecise language and may
      misunderstand instructions. Tests clarity, patience, and re-explanation.
      " "
      <i>Preamble preview:</i>
      "You are roleplaying a first-time user who is unsure what they want. Ask clarifying..."
      " "
      [Import as Draft]
    }
  }
  " "
  {
    {+
      <b>Power User</b>
      --
      Tone: <b>terse</b>  <b>expert</b>
      --
      Simulates an experienced user who expects concise, accurate answers and has low tolerance
      for verbose or hedging responses. Tests efficiency and precision.
      " "
      <i>Preamble preview:</i>
      "You are a senior engineer who uses this product daily. Be terse. Expect technical accuracy..."
      " "
      [Import as Draft]
    }
    |
    {+
      <b>Adversarial Prompter</b>
      --
      Tone: <b>adversarial</b>  <b>probing</b>
      --
      Simulates a user attempting to find edge cases, prompt inject, or elicit policy violations.
      Tests refusal quality, safety boundaries, and graceful degradation.
      " "
      <i>Preamble preview:</i>
      "You are testing the AI system for weaknesses. Try unusual phrasings, boundary-pushing..."
      " "
      [Import as Draft]
    }
  }
  --
  {
    <i>Showing 4 starter personas.  More coming soon.</i> | [Request a Persona Type]
  }
}

@endsalt
